OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see scattered showers, mainly in
OL,7,Fthe north and west. Then showers will
OL,8,Fbecome fewer and lighter during the
OL,9,Fearly hours. Fresh westerly winds
OL,10,Feasing a little.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAfter a dry morning cloud and
OL,13,Frain will spread east for a time in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon. Turning drier in the
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA few
OL,18,Fshowers in the west on Saturday,
OL,19,Flargely dry in the east, windy. Dry
OL,20,Fand bright on Sunday. Rain for a time
OL,21,Fearly on Monday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
